:"https://api.github.com/users/cristian-menesesz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristian-menesesz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristian-menesesz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristian-menesesz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristian-menesesz/knowledge-hub/commits/fdf43a9f17bea670050b7a63cc3ba03346f02677/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-25T15:51:44Z","email":"crismeneseszambrana@gmail.com","name":"Cristian Meneses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-25T15:51:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(infra): Add Terraform and Docker Compose infrastructure (#7)\n\nPhase 0.4: Infrastructure Foundation\n\nTerraform Setup (DEVOPS-IAC-001):\n- Backend configuration with S3 state storage and DynamoDB locking\n- AWS provider setup with default tags\n- Reusable networking module for VPC provisioning\n- Variables and outputs for infrastructure management\n- Development environment configuration\n\nAWS VPC Configuration (DEVOPS-IAC-002):\n- VPC with configurable CIDR block\n- Public and private subnets across availability zones\n- Internet gateway for public access\n- NAT gateway for private subnet internet access\n- Route tables for proper traffic routing\n- Default security group with self-referencing ingress\n- Kubernetes-ready subnet tags for EKS\n\nDocker Compose (DEVOPS-DOCKER-002):\n- PostgreSQL 16 with UUID and full-text search extensions\n- MongoDB 7 with document validation\n- Redis 7 with persistence\n- Meilisearch for full-text search\n- ClickHouse for analytics\n- Kafka + Zookeeper for event streaming\n- MinIO for S3-compatible object storage\n- Mailhog for email testing\n- Health checks for all services\n- Initialization scripts for databases\n- Comprehensive documentation\n\nAll services configured with:\n- Health checks for reliability\n- Volume persistence\n- Environment variable configuration\n- Proper networking\n- Development-optimized defaults","tree":{"sha":"da2e4ac7b3d17056a11b21a12dfc9e8e373462c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristian-menesesz/knowledge-hub/git/trees/da2e4ac7b3d17056a11b21a12dfc9e8e373462c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristian-menesesz/knowledge-hub/git/commits/fdf43a9f17bea670050b7a63cc3ba03346f02677","verification":{"payload":"tree da2e4ac7b3d17056a11b21a12dfc9e8e373462c0\nparent eb91a5bddae81a4af6241adaf01ddf7a188a5f02\nauthor Cristian Meneses <crismeneseszambrana@gmail.com> 1769356304 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769356304 -0400\n\nchore(infra): Add Terraform and Docker Compose infrastructure (#7)\n\nPhase 0.4: Infrastructure Foundation\n\nTerraform Setup (DEVOPS-IAC-001):\n- Backend configuration with S3 state storage and DynamoDB locking\n- AWS provider setup with default tags\n- Reusable networking module for VPC provisioning\n- Variables and outputs for infrastructure management\n- Development environment configuration\n\nAWS VPC Configuration (DEVOPS-IAC-002):\n- VPC with configurable CIDR block\n- Public and private subnets across availability zones\n- Internet gateway for public access\n- NAT gateway for private subnet internet access\n- Route tables for proper traffic routing\n- Default security group with self-referencing ingress\n- Kubernetes-ready subnet tags for EKS\n\nDocker Compose (DEVOPS-DOCKER-002):\n- PostgreSQL 16 with UUID and full-text search extensions\n- MongoDB 7 with document validation\n- Redis 7 with persistence\n- Meilisearch for full-text search\n- ClickHouse for analytics\n- Kafka + Zookeeper for event streaming\n- MinIO for S3-compatible object storage\n- Mailhog for email testing\n- Health checks for all services\n- Initialization scripts for databases\n- Comprehensive documentation\n\nAll services configured with:\n- Health checks for reliability\n- Volume persistence\n- Environment variable configuration\n- Proper netw