ions CI/CD workflows (#6)\n\nCreated three GitHub Actions workflows:\n\n1. ci.yml - Complete PR checks workflow\n   - Parallel jobs: lint, format, typecheck, test, build\n   - Code coverage upload to Codecov\n   - Security audit with npm audit\n   - Final success gate requiring all checks\n\n2. fast-feedback.yml - Quick feedback workflow\n   - Fast sequential checks for rapid feedback\n   - 5min timeout for quick checks\n   - 10min timeout for type check and tests\n   - Build verification as final step\n\n3. dependency-check.yml - Weekly dependency review\n   - Scheduled Monday 9 AM UTC\n   - Manual trigger available\n   - Checks outdated packages and security\n\nFeatures: Concurrency control, Node.js 20 caching,\nTurbo support, professional CI/CD standards\n\nImplements DEVOPS-CI-001 and DEVOPS-CI-002 Phase 0.3","tree":{"sha":"8cdad7949905a21a7bc6b41e11675e77ed92f26e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristian-menesesz/knowledge-hub/git/trees/8cdad7949905a21a7bc6b41e11675e77ed92f26e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristian-menesesz/knowledge-hub/git/commits/eb91a5bddae81a4af6241adaf01ddf7a188a5f02","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cdad7949905a21a7bc6b41e11675e77ed92f26e\nparent 61a913e42f5d26190aeb1fd548e5508b4095758e\nauthor Cristian Meneses <crismeneseszambrana@gmail.com> 1769356003 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769356003 -0400\n\nci(ci): Add comprehensive GitHub Actions CI/CD workflows (#6)\n\nCreated three GitHub Actions workflows:\n\n1. ci.yml - Complete PR checks workflow\n   - Parallel jobs: lint, format, typecheck, test, build\n   - Code coverage upload to Codecov\n   - Security audit with npm audit\n   - Final success gate requiring all checks\n\n2. fast-feedback.yml - Quick feedback workflow\n   - Fast sequential checks for rapid feedback\n   - 5min timeout for quick checks\n   - 10min timeout for type check and tests\n   - Build verification as final step\n\n3. dependency-check.yml - Weekly dependency review\n   - Scheduled Monday