owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/dfcb241554db3bad5f93fbd042a018555739a6f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T14:08:04Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T14:08:04Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"docs: Document database indexing strategy and add composite indexes\n\nAdd comprehensive indexing documentation:\n\n1. Create docs/DATABASE_INDEXES.md:\n   - Complete index inventory for all tables\n   - Query optimization examples with EXPLAIN\n   - Performance impact measurements\n   - Maintenance guidelines\n   - Migration history\n\n2. Update migration 003_add_performance_indexes.sql:\n   - Add idx_articles_category_status_created composite index\n   - Add idx_articles_status_rank for FTS5 queries\n   - Document use case for each index\n\n3. Verify existing indexes in database:\n   - All 001_init_articles_ddd.sql indexes present\n   - SQLite auto-indexes for UNIQUE constraints\n   - No missing critical indexes identified\n\nIndexing strategy covers:\n- Primary key lookups (O(log n))\n- Status + date filtering (published listings)\n- Category + status + date (category listings)\n- Full-text search with status filter\n- Foreign key JOINs\n\nResolves: ''No evidence of proper indexing'' concern","tree":{"sha":"95e24e2e3731532a68d8ebf0235fe971a643562e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/95e24e2e3731532a68d8ebf0235fe971a643562e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/dfcb241554db3bad5f93fbd042a018555739a6f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/dfcb241554db3bad5f93fbd042a018555739a6f7","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKGRmY2IyNDE1NTRkYjNiYWQ1ZjkzZmJkMDQyYTAxODU1NTczOWE2Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8","sha":"c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8"}],"sha":"dfcb241554db3bad5f93fbd042a018555739a6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/dfcb241554db3bad5f93fbd042a018555739a6f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T14:05:20Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T14:05:20Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"perf: Optimize database queries with JOINs and composite indexes\n\nDatabase query optimizations:\n\n1. Add LEFT JOIN for findPublished() method:\n   - Articles and categories fetched in single query using JOIN\n   - Tags still use IN clause (many-to-many relationship)\n   - Reduces queries from 3 to 2 for published articles listing\n\n2. Add loadTagsForArticles() helper method:\n   - Centralized tag loading for multiple articles\n   - Uses efficient IN clause query\n   - Returns organized array by article_id\n\n3. Update hydrateBatch() to use loadTagsForArticles():\n   - Consistent tag loading approach\n   - Better code reuse and maintainability\n\n4. Add composite index migration:\n   - idx_articles_status_created_at: Optimizes findPublished() queries\n   - idx_articles_category_id: Optimizes JOIN with categories table\n\nPerformance impact:\n- findPublished(): 3 queries → 2 queries\n- Better index utilization for common queries\n- Reduced database round-trips","tree":{"sha":"599a6927278eb70ade5504d121326cd028aab014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/599a6927278eb70ade5504d121326cd028aab014"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKGM5Y2I0MzA0MjA3OTg2YzVlMDI5MjhmMTU5NGQxNTY1NjM2ZDNiZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99","sha":"80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99"}],"sha":"c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/c9cb4304207986c5e02928f1594d1565636d3be8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:58:06Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:58:06Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"fix: Remove business logic from repository and eliminate N+1 queries\n\nRepository Pattern fixes:\n\n1. Remove business logic from getAll():\n   - getAll() now returns ALL articles without filtering\n   - Hardcoded ''published'' filter removed\n   - Business logic belongs in use cases, not repositories\n\n2. Add explicit query methods:\n   - findPublished(): Returns only published articles\n   - findByStatus(string): Returns articles filtered by status\n   - These have clear intent and push filtering to SQL level\n\n3. Eliminate N+1 queries:\n   - Removed loadTagsForArticle() which caused separate query per article\n   - hydrate() now uses hydrateBatch() with single-item array\n   - All hydration paths now use efficient batch loading with IN clauses\n   - Reduced queries from 2N+1 to 3 for any number of articles\n\nArchitecture improvements:\n- Repository focuses on data access, not business rules\n- Use cases decide which articles to display\n- Consistent performance regardless of article count","tree":{"sha":"2a66fa5b17bf8ba1a0f89bdf35fbf9810881a60c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/2a66fa5b17bf8ba1a0f89bdf35fbf9810881a60c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKDgwNjc2ZjBjODc1MTA5OWQxYTM3YjUyMGQyMWUxMDlmZmQ4M2FmOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871","sha":"4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871"}],"sha":"80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/80676f0c8751099d1a37b520d21e109ffd83af99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:54:35Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:54:35Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"refactor: Simplify Article::reconstitute() using DTO pattern\n\nReplace 15-parameter reconstitute() method with ArticleReconstitutionData DTO\nto fix code complexity violation and improve maintainability.\n\nChanges:\n- Create ArticleReconstitutionData DTO with 16 properties\n- Add ArticleReconstitutionData::fromArray() factory method for database rows\n- Simplify Article::reconstitute() to accept single DTO parameter\n- Update DoctrineArticleRepository to use named arguments with DTO\n- Update ArticleTest to use new DTO-based API\n- Update documentation with new usage example\n\nBenefits:\n- Reduces parameter count from 16 to 1\n- Named arguments improve readability\n- Type-safe data transfer between layers\n- Easier to add new fields in the future\n- Better IDE autocomplete support","tree":{"sha":"9b5658feea01475e8e752704981a4f2c9be64255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/9b5658feea01475e8e752704981a4f2c9be64255"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKDQ5NDQ4NDZiYzQyNmUyOGIxYWVkYWJhYjEzMWJjYmIyNmM3YzE4NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440","sha":"48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440"}],"sha":"4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4944846bc426e28b1aedabab131bcbb26c7c1871"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:52:01Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:52:01Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"refactor: Move presentation logic from Article entity to ArticleResponseMapper\n\nRemove toArray() and toSummaryArray() methods from Article domain entity\nand move them to ArticleResponseMapper where they belong according to\nclean architecture principles.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove toArray() from Article entity (lines 237-258)\n- Remove toSummaryArray() from Article entity (lines 260-275)\n- Add toArray() and toSummaryArray() to ArticleResponseMapper\n- Update GetArticleById use case to use ArticleResponseMapper\n- Update GetAllArticles use case to use ArticleResponseMapper\n\nThis fixes the architectural violation where domain entities contained\npresentation logic. Domain entities should only contain business logic\nand state, while presentation/formatting belongs in application layer.\n\nNote: UseCaseMapper generic toArray() calls remain for other entities\nthat still use this pattern (e.g., Image, AuditLog).","tree":{"sha":"1ed1060070b44c5788247d799ba9e640b332cbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/1ed1060070b44c5788247d799ba9e640b332cbf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKDQ4Y2UyN2I4NTQzMjQxNTI2NjQ3YTU1MjM4MTU0NDBkOGFiYzY0NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634","sha":"4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634"}],"sha":"48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/48ce27b8543241526647a5523815440d8abc6440"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:49:32Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:49:32Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"refactor: Fix DRY violation in Article entity accessors\n\nRemove duplicate accessor implementations by making domain-style\nmethods (id(), title(), etc.) delegate to getter methods\n(getId(), getTitle(), etc.) instead of duplicating return statements.\n\nThis fixes the DRY violation where both getTitle() and title()\nreturned ->title directly, creating maintenance issues.\n\nChanges:\n- id() now calls getId()\n- title() now calls getTitle()\n- content() now calls getContent()\n- slug() now calls getSlug()\n- status() now calls getStatus()\n- authorId() now calls getAuthorId()\n- category() now calls getCategory()\n- excerpt() now calls getExcerpt()\n- featuredImage() now calls getFeaturedImage()\n- metaDescription() now calls getMetaDescription()\n- viewCount() now calls getViewCount()\n- createdAt() now calls getCreatedAt()\n- updatedAt() now calls getUpdatedAt()\n- publishedAt() now calls getPublishedAt()\n- scheduledAt() now calls getScheduledAt()","tree":{"sha":"e1d07af45302a7a66abc7a3231bf74130dcddc0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/e1d07af45302a7a66abc7a3231bf74130dcddc0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKDRjMmUyMDM0ODlmMTcyNzNiYzAyZjczMTVkZWIzOWFjODcxZWM2MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74","sha":"878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74"}],"sha":"4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/4c2e203489f17273bc02f7315deb39ac871ec634"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:48:09Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:48:09Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"fix: Remove N+1 query performance issues in DoctrineArticleRepository\n\nReplace hydrate() calls with hydrateBatch() for bulk operations:\n- search(): Now uses batch hydration with FTS5 results\n- getByCategory(): Preloads categories and tags for all articles\n- getRecentArticles(): Eliminates N+1 queries for recent articles listing\n\nAdded hydrateBatch() method that:\n- Loads all categories in single query using IN clause\n- Loads all tags in single query with JOIN\n- Hydrates articles with preloaded data\n\nSingle-article lookups (getById, getBySlug) keep using hydrate()\nwhich is acceptable for individual requests.\n\nPerformance impact: Reduces queries from 2N+1 to 3 for N articles.","tree":{"sha":"325f76fe6119f46253fd354d945599a1f39331e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/325f76fe6119f46253fd354d945599a1f39331e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74","node_id":"C_kwDORBB0i9oAKDg3OGJmZmNjNDE3YWE1MmM4ZmEzNmIwYzk4MDkxYTYwY2E1YzljNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commit/63f64f3a3aa41bee9fafd693774c8df623ea6752","sha":"63f64f3a3aa41bee9fafd693774c8df623ea6752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/63f64f3a3aa41bee9fafd693774c8df623ea6752"}],"sha":"878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/878bffcc417aa52c8fa36b0c98091a60ca5c9c74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/63f64f3a3aa41bee9fafd693774c8df623ea6752/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:45:11Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T13:45:11Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"security: Fix multiple security vulnerabilities and add input sanitization\n\n- Add InputSanitizationMiddleware for request sanitization\n- Remove HTTP_HOST header trust vulnerabilities (open redirect)\n- Remove session-based mark authorization (insecure)\n- Make CSRF protection mandatory (remove disable option)\n- Use SessionInterface instead of direct  access\n- Fix DoctrineArticleRepository SQL filtering\n\nSecurity improvements:\n- Prevent open redirect attacks via Host header spoofing\n- Remove insecure session flags for authorization\n- Centralized input sanitization for XSS prevention\n- Proper dependency injection for session handling","tree":{"sha":"8bfac7375e9491acbd5293e4f6877e59151dd5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/8bfac7375e9491acbd5293e4f6877e59151dd5f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/63f64f3a3aa41bee9fafd693774c8df623ea6752","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use