_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":"evan70","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/7ecfb4afd4cad042e0036158602302572c6008b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T21:25:40Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T21:25:40Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"feat: Enhance installation, authentication, and security features\n\nThis comprehensive commit addresses several key areas to improve the blog application:\n\n- **Installer Robustness:**\n  - Dynamic Migration Discovery: MigrationRunner now automatically scans for SQL migration files, removing hardcoded lists.\n  - Pathing Corrections: Resolved issues with incorrect file paths in installer and migration runner scripts.\n  - Centralized DB Config: Installer now generates  from , and  uses it as the primary source of truth.\n  - Refactored with Paths Class: Standardized path resolution using the  utility.\n  - Cleaned Summary Output: Improved installer summary display.\n  - Inline Comment Fix: Correctly strips inline comments from  values, preventing config pollution and resolving the \"database missing\" verification issue.\n\n- **Authentication & Security:**\n  - Consolidated  DB Migrations: Merged conflicting initial  database schemas, integrating  and fixing  errors.\n  - Fixed  DB Migration: Escaped single quotes in sample article content to resolve SQL syntax errors.\n  - Removed ''shared'' Migration: Eliminated problematic ''shared'' migration directory.\n  - UUID Usage Enforcement: Ensured evan evan domain uses BLOB UUIDs, while other domains (forms, articles) now use simple string/integer IDs for consistency with Value Objects.\n  - Refactored Value Objects: Non-user Value Objects (e.g., , ) now handle simple string IDs, removing  dependency and resolving  errors.\n  -  ID Generation: Updated  entity to generate simple string IDs using .\n  - Admin Role Correction: Set default admin user role to  in migration.\n  - Configurable Session Expiration: Introduced  env var for explicit control over session cookie lifetime.\n  - Configurable Rate Limiting: Externalized rate limit rules to  and made configurable via , enabled via .\n  - Enabled CSRF Protection: Uncommented  in the service configuration, activating CSRF validation.\n  - Configurable Password Strength: Implemented a configurable password strength policy via  and , centralizing validation in .\n\n- **User Interface:**\n  - New Mark-Styled Auth Forms: Created new  and  templates in  with consistent Mark dashboard styling.","tree":{"sha":"b13025e3378a24c43e7be11e94ad6a8bdcc8799f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/b13025e3378a24c43e7be11e94ad6a8bdcc8799f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/7ecfb4afd4cad042e0036158602302572c6008b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evan70","id":67433,"login":