om/users/evan70/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/56b148d7ad6c4eb8f192a6d0333f2f5009660f51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T09:11:45Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T09:13:03Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"Refactor Authorization to proper service-based architecture\n\nProblems solved:\n- Static state causing testability issues\n- Global state causing concurrency problems\n- Dependency Inversion Principle violations\n- Tight coupling to direct session access\n\nSolution implemented:\n- AuthorizationService: Proper injectable service\n- Dependency injection via container\n- Backward compatibility through Authorization wrapper\n- Comprehensive test coverage\n\nBenefits:\n- Easy to mock and test\n- No global state issues\n- Proper DI container usage\n- Maintains backward compatibility\n- Follows SOLID principles","tree":{"sha":"2172db02fcb844b13f0a8f2bd1f7e528712c1a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/2172db02fcb844b13f0a8f2bd1f7e528712c1a39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/56b148d7ad6c4eb8f192a6d0333f2f5009660f51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70