red_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/commits/057d3eaa71f71804c2b350fd5e77054cf2c75ef2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T09:06:46Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T09:06:46Z","email":"ivan.paldan@yandex.com","name":"Ivan Paldan"},"message":"Fix critical slug uniqueness issues in CreateArticle\n\nProblems fixed:\n- Race condition between slug uniqueness check and save\n- Inefficient loop creating multiple Slug objects unnecessarily\n- Poor performance with database queries in loop\n- Potential infinite loop without maximum iteration limit\n\nImprovements:\n- Extract slug uniqueness logic to dedicated findUniqueSlug method\n- Add maximum attempt limit (100) to prevent infinite loops\n- Reduce object creation overhead\n- More efficient algorithm with early return\n- Better error handling for edge cases\n\nSecurity & Performance:\n- Prevents race conditions in concurrent article creation\n- Eliminates potential DoS via infinite loops\n- Reduces database load by minimizing queries\n- Provides clear error messages for edge cases","tree":{"sha":"70934899adfa92fdcd06f4d50bdf0c56ca680968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/trees/70934899adfa92fdcd06f4d50bdf0c56ca680968"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/responsive-sk/resp-native-boot-DDD/git/commits/057d3eaa71f71804c2b350fd5e77054cf2c75ef2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evan70/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users