m/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/59ef142475189865ea1ca81a4796f849a0fdff07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:49:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:49:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(canvas): open OpenAI global MCP App entrypoints from the sidebar\n\nChatGPT opens a `global` entrypoint from its sidebar as one permanent,\nfullscreen app. Pulse previously opened these only as canvas nodes.\n\n- Add an Apps section to the left Sidebar (and icons on the collapsed\n  rail) listing `global` entrypoints from the global agent scope.\n- Open an app at `/apps/<server>/<tool>` in the main area. A keep-alive\n  host keeps one instance per tool across views and workspaces, with\n  reload and close in its bar.\n- Show the tool''s MCP `icons`: the engine re-reads them from `tools/list`\n  (ai-sdk `tools()` drops them), the main process validates and inlines\n  them as data URIs, and SVG renders as a `currentColor` mask. Apps\n  without an icon keep a letter tile.\n- Share the `{}` open path between canvas nodes and global apps\n  (`useMcpAppEntrypoint`) and let embedded frames report `fullscreen`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jzo5GPsoyHpHptYq5Yymoz","tree":{"sha":"65bced4c6de761f019e8342f47efa1fc3d5c15da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/65bced4c6de761f019e8342f47efa1fc3d5c15da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/59ef142475189865ea1ca81a4796f849a0fdff07","verification":{"payload":"tree 65bced4c6de761f019e8342f47efa1fc3d5c15da\nparent 76595e4a842a7150e4b852be68651ef4369f0de6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791211796 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791218957 +0000\n\nfeat(canvas): open OpenAI global MCP App entrypoints from the sidebar\n\nChatGPT opens a `global` entrypoint from its sidebar as one permanent,\nfullscreen app. Pulse previously opened these only as canvas nodes.\n\n- Add an Apps section to the left Sidebar (and icons on the collapsed\n  rail) listing `global` entrypoints from the global agent scope.\n- Open an app at `/apps/<server>/<tool>` in the main area. A keep-alive\n  host keeps one instance per tool across views and workspaces, with\n  reload and close in its bar.\n- Show the tool''s MCP `icons`: the engine re-reads them from `tools/list`\n  (ai-sdk `tools()` drops them), the main process validates and inlines\n  them as data URIs, and SVG renders as a `currentColor` mask. Apps\n  without an icon keep a letter tile.\n- Share the `{}` open path between canvas nodes and global apps\n  (`useMcpAppEntrypoint`) and let embedded frames report `fullscreen`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jzo5GPsoyHpHptYq5Yymoz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFzIbd1W\n1KWmGiYVHakZo7A8Nblwhl8bsLLukNclGJfEikmz8hOc1sJoPf5bP+fdlDFOJWmWcber8nL+si+u\nMwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T23:03:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude