pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/2d8a402f960f032dd9908b4d92d7f0943ce87d52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:52:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:52:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(canvas-chat): carry node ids in chat mention markers\n\nNode chips serialized only their display label (`@[label]`), so a sent\nchip lost its node after a rename and picked the first match among\nduplicate titles.\n\n- Composer node chips now serialize `@[node:<nodeId>|<label>]`, or\n  `@[node:<workspaceId>:<nodeId>|<label>]` across workspaces. Only `%`,\n  `|` and `]` in the label are escaped so the model reads it as prose.\n- Rendering resolves id markers by id only and shows the node''s current\n  label; a deleted node becomes an inert chip instead of jumping to a\n  same-named node. Legacy `@[label]` markers keep resolving by label.\n- Session titles show the marker label, not the id.\n- The selection focus prompt documents the marker so the model can cite\n  nodes back as clickable chips.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013kSHBWZU5AarMbEAFTTbig","tree":{"sha":"c620034f6b2bed937fe0b3912f74676ce53d0d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/c620034f6b2bed937fe0b3912f74676ce53d0d0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/2d8a402f960f032dd9908b4d92d7f0943ce87d52","verification":{"payload":"tree c620034f6b2bed937fe0b3912f74676ce53d0d0b\nparent 4dfb3af88f6d4a2de03026681248fca83616d468\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791168746 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791168746 +0000\n\nfeat(canvas-chat): carry node ids in chat mention markers\n\nNode chips serialized only their display label (`@[label]`), so a sent\nchip lost its node after a rename and picked the first match among\nduplicate titles.\n\n- Composer node chips now serialize `@[node:<nodeId>|<label>]`, or\n  `@[node:<workspaceId>:<nodeId>|<label>]` across workspaces. Only `%`,\n  `|` and `]` in the label are escaped so the model reads it as prose.\n- Rendering resolves id markers by id only and shows the node''s current\n  label; a deleted node becomes an inert chip instead of jumping to a\n  same-named node. Legacy `@[label]` markers keep resolving by label.\n- Session titles show the marker label, not the id.\n- The selection focus prompt documents the marker so the model can cite\n  nodes back as clickable chips.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013kSHBWZU5AarMbEAFTTbig\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOSRgNLr\nIMwC5MHniE5G5xPbxW0bPbzN+j4WQB1u+aixF3+qr5oUc97LPTl28dI20Fn4WX3stoi2uxvPsuMj\niAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T02:52:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://