"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47221942?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang","id":47221942,"login":"hua-bang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjIxOTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/2c3a0f073e99593062c6904fcc5239df51c50eaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T12:56:20Z","email":"huabang001124@gmail.com","name":"Jasper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T12:56:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Support abort signal propagation to context compaction (#1081)\n\n* fix(engine): make context compaction respect Stop\n\nPressing Stop during pre-loop context compaction had no effect until the\nsummary LLM call finished, so long conversations kept \"Working\" for\ntens of seconds after Stop. Forward the run''s abort signal to the\nsummary call, return the abort sentinel right after compaction, and\nnever apply a compaction result (including the lossy prune fallback)\nonce the run is stopped. The Pi backend''s host compaction gets the\nsame signal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013hYFuDoJi3PvoCVoGwHde5\n\n* fix(engine): discard a compaction summary that resolves after Stop\n\nA provider can resolve the summary call after the signal aborts. Recheck\nthe signal right after the call so maybeCompactContext never returns a\nreplacement for a stopped run, also for direct Engine.compactContext\ncallers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013hYFuDoJi3PvoCVoGwHde5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed535969c6a9e85d890b537c327f3c42addaa296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/ed535969c6a9e85d890b537c327f3c42addaa296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/2c3a0f073e99593062c6904fcc5239df51c50eaa","verification":{"payload":"tree ed535969c6a9e85d890b537c327f3c42addaa296\nparent 6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6\nauthor Jasper <huabang001124@gmail.com> 1791118580 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791118580 +0800\n\nSupport abort signal propagation to context compaction (#1081)\n\n* fix(engine): make context compaction respect Stop\n\nPressing Stop during pre-loop context compaction had no effect until the\nsummary LLM call finished, so long conversations kept \"Working\" for\ntens of seconds after Stop. Forward the run''s abort signal to the\nsummary call, return the abort sentinel right after compaction, and\nnever apply a compaction result (including the lossy prune fallback)\nonce the run is stopped. The Pi backend''s host compaction gets the\nsame signal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013hYFuDoJi3PvoCVoGwHde5\n\n* fix(engine): discard a compaction summary that resolves after Stop\n\nA provider can resolve the summary call after the signal aborts. Recheck\nthe signal right after the call so maybeCompactContext never returns a\nreplacement for a stopped run, also for direct Engine.compactContext\ncallers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013hYFuDoJi3PvoCVoGwHde5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwkz0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJt4QAFgrOG/XKiZTC29I/WQojLec\nw5JGcHYWeuqYWH7In4BcYC5kYciG/fx0+HBff+9u+2rmcrJahI5R6FV6tjCUgJs1\nrunxPpc1bwX/13y8neuTI1oZP2fMGsW7htiZymCycr+s11DdypjmXIp9HEs9Z4zh\nSh96Oynn6rd2kwK4eOcsc6jv0V9bKCV23OGjstX70tZDZPOMB52Ls1ZjdqJg0mHN\nef4b2+wyJBUInoFh5rhapXxvXQWui3DGHlUPaxoxU3KZ71M5iogkprTmDRot09Rs\nqlrpOPGk/XtnTyLX2MhwxO2npLbgqdvNRKmgC3j0aXvfIL0fdZuICJZsdeqY7A6V\nN4cx23L/nEtOzfBtA25ImUyqYYAtf2UjnCu+q7PRsMAToVWhhV7UsiSXZmZSnTtZ\nZg+/bGaT0A0xAuXNzfmrLtC3QFYAw1N0Ac1XO+YoJ6u50dII0/Iyz8XQu2o8uNjx\n8EHbat2Gknxw3Y7JAg0Nnp4CCChsS86DyeiuYQk4Xo6jb/cMpukZOK0jRm3UX7Vx\nUbx6WbeGiuqVzR1yuM28aIMayZieypzUC+HS2ZVMWSJd+UYuNpIG/aGXCom+ItCp\nH3Cxhh/SoNfAu4IRDS9PoziE8ynIafvYAsBCIDGXKZxRli7yi4BPRG4nUqpY1U5h\nHCbuXkKYj3iavJpMIOEq\n=SSAR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T12:56:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commit/2c3a0f073e99593062c6904fcc5239df51c50eaa","node_id":"C_kwDORBlpqtoAKDJjM2EwZjA3M2U5OTU5MzA2MmM2OTA0ZmNjNTIzOWRmNTFjNTBlYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commit/6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6","sha":"6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6"}],"sha":"2c3a0f073e99593062c6904fcc5239df51c50eaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/2c3a0f073e99593062c6904fcc5239df51c50eaa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47221942?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang","id":47221942,"login":"hua-bang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjIxOTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T12:55:51Z","email":"huabang001124@gmail.com","name":"Jasper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T12:55:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(canvas): connect anonymous plugin MCPs before OAuth (#1084)\n\n* fix(canvas): connect anonymous plugin MCPs before OAuth\n\nGuard against treating missing OAuth tokens as failed MCP connections. Regression tests cover anonymous success, retry, transport 401 challenges and non-authentication failures.\n\n* fix(canvas): restore interactive MCP OAuth after token expiry\n\nRecognize the Canvas provider authorization request after a transport challenge. The recovery regression fails without this gate and passes after it.","tree":{"sha":"eda10658d990cbf22b5b132b4216c611c2b1d933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/eda10658d990cbf22b5b132b4216c611c2b1d933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/6b037d5ebe8cb66865de7a3114b75262e5be09f6","verification":{"payload":"tree eda10658d990cbf22b5b132b4216c611c2b1d933\nparent 5996bd567cdfee026bdade1d8500e94741a25152\nauthor Jasper <huabang001124@gmail.com> 1791118551 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791118551 +0800\n\nfix(canvas): connect anonymous plugin MCPs before OAuth (#1084)\n\n* fix(canvas): connect anonymous plugin MCPs before OAuth\n\nGuard against treating missing OAuth tokens as failed MCP connections. Regression tests cover anonymous success, retry, transport 401 challenges and non-authentication failures.\n\n* fix(canvas): restore interactive MCP OAuth after token expiry\n\nRecognize the Canvas provider authorization request after a transport challenge. The recovery regression fails without this gate and passes after it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwkzXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6VMQADTCM558Q8NapsmAHBVb3NUJ\nX5saO3H+6zmszMKDaPZoomSqUU0BiRbqJN0o1IBoJ7d4Xtc8hlSVgjyJyI/i/wv0\nPNK7uqRpUpqK9amOGHRuvZDlq0110/U78QQDRU4gOE+dIoQMalAUmvk+Uf4nBitz\nJAG+SHT7RrFxxd7jVcWL29kYiF1Lcuxdz6iG1b2XfVThzVIiEyb5ROwNQfviL68L\nPTOfhgPZd7ZOJjACGyaiQ3jSOvX6+o7dIUkA8i9yohaGDA6Aj3vVZ2yr6ruVh6UW\ntWJVZxN1pvYvc52VX+xWHp1HpTEOlPq2yUw2UYmHnzMCtdqgRiaLbNHdj9ncQuTD\nTA+bccOxeAWqBIzF9trU016gE/Jh0xho+Afy3Bo1Tt2IxyaVoeA0odKmbsvZp