comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/ceef7bea633a74f8b71beed89a1380e1b01c2d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:51:57Z","email":"huabang001124@gmail.com","name":"Jasper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:51:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(engine,canvas): keep history array identity so the agent stops repeating tool calls (#1079)\n\nThe loop pruned dangling tool-call parts by reassigning context.messages.\nCanvas appends step messages to the array it captured before the run, so\nafter a prune the loop read a detached copy: the model never saw its own\ntool results and repeated the same calls until maxSteps. Compaction in the\nCanvas engine and Pi backends detached the array the same way.\n\nPrune now splices in place, and the Canvas backends rely on the in-place\nreplaceMessages write-back instead of reassigning context.messages.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U9g7QmPqU9tLdZUnWFYkSJ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed86e986694f53b54d7436781b7fdcd9b47eddfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/ed86e986694f53b54d7436781b7fdcd9b47eddfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/ceef7bea633a74f8b71beed89a1380e1b01c2d6c","verification":{"payload":"tree ed86e986694f53b54d7436781b7fdcd9b47eddfd\nparent 38504228be5e28089020c896d60bd5fdf985b19c\nauthor Jasper <huabang001124@gmail.com> 1791114717 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791114717 +0800\n\nfix(engine,canvas): keep history array identity so the agent stops repeating tool calls (#1079)\n\nThe loop pruned dangling tool-call parts by reassigning context.messages.\nCanvas appends step messages to the array it captured before the run, so\nafter a prune the loop read a detached copy: the model never saw its own\ntool results and repeated the same calls until maxSteps. Compaction in the\nCanvas e