MjAzZWYwNTQxZmYxZGJmYjUzMjFmYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commit/6a780bcef9ee096103659b9cb6bbba927d55d902","sha":"6a780bcef9ee096103659b9cb6bbba927d55d902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/6a780bcef9ee096103659b9cb6bbba927d55d902"}],"sha":"87ac4663f05f260e9203ef0541ff1dbfb5321fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/87ac4663f05f260e9203ef0541ff1dbfb5321fc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47221942?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hua-bang","id":47221942,"login":"hua-bang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjIxOTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hua-bang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/commits/6a780bcef9ee096103659b9cb6bbba927d55d902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:27:26Z","email":"huabang001124@gmail.com","name":"Jasper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:27:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Refresh canvas visual style: neutral palette, softer cards, alternating nested frames (#1054)\n\n* Refresh canvas visual style: neutral palette, softer cards, alternating nested frames\n\nStyle-only pass on the canvas surface; layout, node structure and toolbar\ncontents are unchanged.\n\n- Tokens: warm grays become neutral grays; card/float shadows are softer and\n  wider; new canvas tokens for node/frame radius, node border and the nested\n  frame wash; glass chrome tokens for floating canvas controls.\n- Nodes: 14px radius, lighter border, header divider made transparent (keeps\n  the 32px chrome height).\n- Frames: 20px radius; nested frames alternate between a gray wash and white\n  by frame nesting depth, so each level is a surface change instead of\n  white-on-white. frameHierarchy now reports depth (collectNestedFrameDepths).\n- Floating toolbar and zoom indicator: translucent glass, larger radius, ink\n  active state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n* Keep the accent blue for the floating toolbar active state\n\nThe ink (near-black) selection read as a new brand color; restore the\nexisting accent-light / accent pair and drop the unused chrome-active tokens.\nThe glass surface, radius and border of the toolbar stay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n* Fix perf entry-gzip gate: slim nested-frame wiring, rebaseline to 214KB\n\nCI perf failed on bundle.entry_gzip_kb (214KB vs limit 213KB). origin/master\nalready measures 218593B (213.47KB), 31 bytes under the old 207KB +3% limit,\nso any entry growth trips it.\n\n- Trim the nested-frame depth wiring: inline the class suffix (depth map only\n  holds frames, so no type check), rename the prop to frameDepth, drop the\n  0 default, and use a shorter even-depth class.\n- Reset the ratchet baseline to the measured 214KB (limit 220KB) with the\n  measurement recorded in basis; target 185 / warning 210 unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7927476efe2dad82ca9afbe8882350b16e19a71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/b7927476efe2dad82ca9afbe8882350b16e19a71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/6a780bcef9ee096103659b9cb6bbba927d55d902","verification":{"payload":"tree b7927476efe2dad82ca9afbe8882350b16e19a71\nparent 11741077d074e616333a059d1b87080a5b98b38e\nauthor Jasper <huabang001124@gmail.com> 1790512046 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790512046 +0800\n\nRefresh canvas visual style: neutral palette, softer cards, alternating nested frames (#1054)\n\n* Refresh canvas visual style: neutral palette, softer cards, alternating nested frames\n\nStyle-only pass on the canvas surface; layout, node structure and toolbar\ncontents are unchanged.\n\n- Tokens: warm grays become neutral grays; card/float shadows are softer and\n  wider; new canvas tokens for node/frame radius, node border and the nested\n  frame wash; glass chrome tokens for floating canvas controls.\n- Nodes: 14px radius, lighter border, header divider made transparent (keeps\n  the 32px chrome height).\n- Frames: 20px radius; nested frames alternate between a gray wash and white\n  by frame nesting depth, so each level is a surface change instead of\n  white-on-white. frameHierarchy now reports depth (collectNestedFrameDepths).\n- Floating toolbar and zoom indicator: translucent glass, larger radius, ink\n  active state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n* Keep the accent blue for the floating toolbar active state\n\nThe ink (near-black) selection read as a new brand color; restore the\nexisting accent-light / accent pair and drop the unused chrome-active tokens.\nThe glass surface, radius and border of the toolbar stay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n* Fix perf entry-gzip gate: slim nested-frame wiring, rebaseline to 214KB\n\nCI perf failed on bundle.entry_gzip_kb (214KB vs limit 213KB). origin/master\nalready measures 218593B (213.47KB), 31 bytes under the old 207KB +3% limit,\nso any entry growth trips it.\n\n- Trim the nested-frame depth wiring: inline the class suffix (depth map only\n  holds frames, so no type check), rename the prop to frameDepth, drop the\n  0 default, and use a shorter even-depth class.\n- Reset the ratchet baseline to the measured 214KB (limit 220KB) with the\n  measurement recorded in basis; target 185 / warning 210 unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LsRhki6xEVQ44nxcX33Qrf\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquQuuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX2MQAF2AN51u+rZ/REV/8aQhC9MU\n91UkRemMRgtUxYbyBY++WqpS3T4uonRNezVYo3UPacPl4M5kPJ5IC9FgzHzi8MYC\n1Gu3grbtiQPp/AS6WaRXLkI6dXRWQNFO0yLK0T2qmoB5OSc6V/Q4UhoD6XqV3Gj3\n84ibAgZk+SPEUCHuSJXXEXVzmZ5/5cB/9vsnJUZSeYVAgfQPqQM5SZ8qApnIR7/O\nl+k6BRClFTrEVGs/YHb2tnpeYHJqRkEYPFJuYoUVTmVa5qpqBMesrb3pDRso0ABq\ndnRusNVC1gLuXQxw8TBPJCG8tHEld/krsCJV5DsOGe+QIVFLpCZRkdpOMK0UUW4/\nTTVBiQF7U4sIvUCNq5LKxy0kwCThT/uYYZG62EN+Q96sA8+evBq9MObKA4d6fz7c\n6luH2s4AZeDywx53kYOu+OVW6cdmU+4qDlpmGJHUhHc1hKmouplIsHCdsfoLrNGl\nvFgribAn3NOK+A9YCncsv+/6eAa1ryP70AcfKelpSjHcG/ILNCXtrb6PQceBWPKp\nyhqcO/+gWiHzEM69WwrtEM4i+ax0xwIXNGT253n7Q3feNpKv3lgAWeGhl9T+pP8/\nRxUNW+AtCu0ukfvNSPJ4yv9NiZ9i9S4Hp6M0v2D5T3JS/39n7L2IPfj6QCnrV7PG\n3ex3cR0XER4fKe9kUZNO\n=MSyH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T12:27:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://