 the caller''s current context.\n- If the index is stale or the pre-turn save fails, the runtime restores\n  its previous history and returns CHAT_RECOVERY_REJECTED. Before, a\n  later ordinary send could persist the uncommitted cut.\n- The renderer restores its optimistic truncation when the replacement\n  is rejected or fails to start.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ssc1wCNTgSjRPjz2uMiz5d\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f41f733c654fa7f6eecd1d88b01257c62d27ab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/trees/5f41f733c654fa7f6eecd1d88b01257c62d27ab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hua-bang/pulse-agent/git/commits/62dca943e84bb27ce3262ff70267fa8f5bee0e07","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f41f733c654fa7f6eecd1d88b01257c62d27ab0\nparent 3fbf8b82c9b7e05f889dda2e8c8efca2b3cfa5a4\nauthor Jasper <huabang001124@gmail.com> 1790293178 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790293178 +0800\n\nfix(canvas): keep recovery context and undo rejected edit/regenerate (#1042)\n\nReview follow-ups for edit/regenerate:\n- Resend the original turn''s recorded contextSnapshot (selection, tabs,\n  plugins, execution mode) instead of the caller''s current context.\n- If the index is stale or the pre-turn save fails, the runtime restores\n  its previous history and returns CHAT_RECOVERY_REJECTED. Before, a\n  later ordinary send could persist the uncommitted cut.\n- The renderer restores its optimistic truncation when the replacement\n  is rejected or fails to start.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ssc1wCNTgSjRPjz2uMiz5d\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtbS6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV7oQAFohUHK+U8z0AI/TturR6U6+\n7HBoYpKEl0dCogj6mtztzdJXEhIE/F0Q3ANLEn9Rr3321pb5Y50OrCNjJMGTq1Q0\n+1QBRm183dx1PMYAedcuHJ3VWQgFqUux9O3vCPDNIwiZ8W8rgmReKNjy/khTN6r7\nUMDZuxICLR4GDGmNzI1pGjyEj8eMbP6r2nRTmBHV10TxaiwleUnBYBt