ing) + enhance 6 existing docs\nPhase 3.5: Add nice-to-have docs (WhiteLabelArchitecture, AICodingAssistant)\nPhase 4: Update README, CURRICULUM, AGENTS metadata for 63 documents\n\nNew documents:\n- features/Authentication.md (2,643 lines) - JWT, OAuth2, social login, AuthBloc\n- features/WebView.md (2,433 lines) - PG payment, JS Bridge, hybrid apps\n- infrastructure/VersionMigration.md (1,338 lines) - FVM, dart fix, migration\n- infrastructure/DependencyManagement.md (1,206 lines) - pub outdated, OSV Scanner\n- infrastructure/Troubleshooting.md (2,126 lines) - build/runtime error resolution\n- advanced/WhiteLabelArchitecture.md (2,710 lines) - multi-tenant, flavor branding\n- system/AICodingAssistant.md (1,825 lines) - AI tools, prompt engineering\n\nEnhanced existing documents:\n- system/AppLifecycle.md (+405 lines) - State Restoration (RestorationMixin)\n- fundamentals/DartAdvanced.md (+175 lines) - Dart Macros\n- infrastructure/PlatformIntegration.md (+276 lines) - home_widget, watchOS/WearOS\n- system/Testing.md (+751 lines) - Device Farm, i18n screenshot testing\n- fundamentals/WidgetFundamentals.md (+480 lines) - declarative UI, CJK text input\n- advanced/ModularArchitecture.md (+174 lines) - module communication patterns\n- system/Performance.md - Impeller Flutter 3.38 update\n- system/Accessibility.md - textScaleFactor→TextScaler migration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1b3e2aefa52c7ba2fa302ec248202482c0b5d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/trees/c1b3e2aefa52c7ba2fa302ec248202482c0b5d17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/commits/439fa957953e49d7f5cb913b223a9a5dc9a6af28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6122066?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com