terLoader\n- PlatformIntegration.md: remove invalid iOS destroyContext()\n- AdvancedStateManagement.md: remove @injectable on Blocs\n- Animation.md: add Flutter 3.27+ version requirement for withValues()\n\nMEDIUM/LOW (8):\n- BlocUiEffect.md: add thread-safety comment on OneTimeEffect\n- Freezed.md: add toARGB32() version compatibility note\n- Fpdart.md: differentiate NetworkException in error mapping\n- AdvancedPatterns.md: print() to debugPrint()\n- Architecture.md: clarify rolloutPercentage range\n- ModularArchitecture.md: parameterize build target\n- Pagination.md: add error message handling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9288b40772ff02598b0d80f2dd5dec5b41a8a749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/trees/9288b40772ff02598b0d80f2dd5dec5b41a8a749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/commits/da511fec7901f7f16adbee587e0108bc512b4b0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6122066?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hoyuo","id":6122066,"login":"Hoyuo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjIwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hoyuo/flutter-st