Hoyuo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjIwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hoyuo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/commits/782c48cb68373e307eba066ca679f47ac37a33f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-26T16:49:03Z","email":"psh9907@gmail.com","name":"Hoyuo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-26T16:49:03Z","email":"psh9907@gmail.com","name":"Hoyuo"},"message":"Add ErrorHandling, Theming, AppLifecycle guides\n\nErrorHandling.md:\n- Failure sealed class design (Network, Server, Client, etc.)\n- Dio error interceptor and exception mapping\n- Error UI patterns (snackbar, dialog, fullscreen)\n- Retry patterns with exponential backoff\n- Global error handling (auth, crashlytics)\n\nTheming.md:\n- Material 3 theme setup (light/dark)\n- Custom colors with ThemeExtension\n- Typography system\n- Design tokens (spacing, radius, shadows)\n- Theme switching with Bloc\n- Component styling patterns\n\nAppLifecycle.md:\n- AppLifecycleState handling\n- WidgetsBindingObserver and AppLifecycleListener\n- Global lifecycle service\n- Bloc integration\n- Common use cases (data sync, websocket, session timeout)\n- State persistence on background\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5eceb0edcfbe014c935b6e95adf13a69085960f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/trees/5eceb0edcfbe014c935b6e95adf13a69085960f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hoyuo/flutter-study/git/commits/782c48cb68373e307eba066ca679f47ac37a33f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ver